cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "The last missing splitting patterns in two theta fields"
abstract: "For every real L from 14493/4, the interval (L,4L/3] contains all nine joint degree-one trace pairs on the 547/727 and 571/599 fields. All sixteen quadratic sign patterns occur from 26211/4. Both thresholds are sharp. A finite table classifies all misses at any factor at least 4/3. A separate progression estimate supplies explicit lower and upper mass bounds on shrinking intervals."
